MID_GmapMenu_Enter: Enter
MID_GmapMenu_Enter_Help: Enter the area to walk around.
MID_GmapMenu_Dungeon: Explore Dungeon
MID_GmapMenu_Dungeon_Help: Enter the dungeon to explore it.
MID_GmapMenu_GodlyPortal: Gate of the Gods
MID_GmapMenu_GodlyPortal_Help: Teleport to another temple through\na Gate of the Gods you can access.
MID_GmapMenu_ExPortal: Warp Device
MID_GmapMenu_ExPortal_Help: Teleport to another location with\nan unlocked warp device.
MID_GmapMenu_Explore: Search
MID_GmapMenu_Explore_Help: Search for materials. You may also\ndiscover new locations.
MID_GmapMenu_Banquet: Feast
MID_GmapMenu_Banquet_Help: Use ingredients to hold a feast.\nRestores HP and magic. Increases\nsupport points for all allies.
MID_GmapMenu_Carriage: Carriage
MID_GmapMenu_Carriage_Help: Ride to a previously visited\nposthouse to cover long\ndistances quickly.
MID_GmapMenu_Talk: Talk
MID_GmapMenu_Talk_Help: Talk to people at this location.
MID_GmapMenu_Facility: Use Facilities
MID_GmapMenu_Facility_Help: Use this location's facilities.
MID_GmapMenu_Fix: Wait
MID_GmapMenu_Fix_Help: End your action and wait.
MID_GmapMenu_ContinueMove: Keep Moving
MID_GmapMenu_ContinueMove_Help: Continue down the road.
MID_GmapMenu_CallAnimal: Lure
MID_GmapMenu_CallAnimal_Help: Place bait to attract an animal.
MID_GmapMenu_CaptureAnimal: Capture
MID_GmapMenu_CaptureAnimal_Help: Attempt to catch a lured animal.
MID_GmapMenu_MakeFarm: Farm
MID_GmapMenu_MakeFarm_Help: Create a plot of land to increase the\nyield of certain plants.
MID_GmapMenu_ReMakeFarm: New Farm
MID_GmapMenu_ReMakeFarm_Help: Abandon the current field to create\na new one.
MID_GmapMenu_BoostFarm: Fertilize
MID_GmapMenu_BoostFarm_Help: Spread fertilizer on a field to\nimprove the chances of harvesting\nrare plants.
MID_GmapMenu_Recruit: Recruit Soldiers
MID_GmapMenu_Recruit_Help: Gain a new battalion of soldiers.
MID_GmapMenu_Recruit_ForceBoost: Recruiting Drive
MID_GmapMenu_Recruit_ForceBoost_Help: Recruit battalions with greater\nchance of high-quality soldiers.
MID_GmapMenu_BoostRecruit: Rousing Speech
MID_GmapMenu_BoostRecruit_Help: Raises effectiveness of Recruit\nSoldiers, allowing for a greater\nchance of high-quality battalions.
MID_GmapMenu_LegionDispatch: Deploy
MID_GmapMenu_LegionDispatch_Explore: Deploy to Search
MID_GmapMenu_LegionDispatch_Explore_Help: Direct a battalion to spend its\ntime searching for materials.
MID_GmapMenu_LegionDispatch_Reconstruction: Deploy to Rebuild
MID_GmapMenu_LegionDispatch_Reconstruction_Help: Direct a battalion to speed up\nrebuilding work.
MID_GmapMenu_LegionReDispatch: Redeploy
MID_GmapMenu_LegionReDispatch_Help: Recall a deployed battalion and\ndeploy it to this location.
MID_GmapMenu_LegionDispatch_Fort: Deploy to Defend
MID_GmapMenu_LegionDispatch_Fort_Help: Direct a battalion to defend a\nstronghold from enemy forces.
MID_GmapMenu_Blade: Answerer's Cry
MID_GmapMenu_Blade_Help: Reveals foes lurking at locations\nwithin range.
MID_GmapMenu_Show: Perform
MID_GmapMenu_Show_Help: Give a performance and receive\nrewards or information in return.
MID_GmapMenu_CorpsCreate: Form Squad
MID_GmapMenu_CorpsCreate_Help: Organize allies into a squad to\ndeploy them.
MID_GmapMenu_CorpsDelete: Disband Squad
MID_GmapMenu_CorpsDelete_Help: Disband a squad and send allies\nback to Dagsion.
MID_GmapMenu_CorpsExchange: Swap Members
MID_GmapMenu_CorpsExchange_Help: Transfer allies from one squad\nto another.
MID_GmapMenu_CorpsDivide: Split Squad
MID_GmapMenu_CorpsDivide_Help: Split a squad to deploy the two\nnew ones as separate squads.
MID_GmapMenu_Reconstruction: Rebuild
MID_GmapMenu_Reconstruction_Help: Use the required materials to\nrestore a location.
MID_GmapMenu_DestroyMiasma: Dispel Miasma
MID_GmapMenu_DestroyMiasma_Help: Dispel a single level of miasma.\nDense miasma requires dispelling\nmultiple levels to remove.
MID_GmapMenu_Hellgate: Underworld Gate
MID_GmapMenu_Hellgate_Help: Proceed to an underworld gate and\nfight the foes guarding it.
